From: Willian Barreto <willianbarreto1909@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Add virtual output support (ported to the pinned HDR branch)

Source: https://github.com/niri-wm/niri/pull/3800
Upstream-commit: 7fd585dd44ed67644977dd9561bb6e8b3837f8f7
Base: losnoco/niri d9131c336ed291ad235a6b46f9af960a45f2bad4

Adapt the headless render signature and TTY imports to the HDR fork.
Retain the fork's redraw scheduling for physical outputs, but pace virtual
outputs using their estimated vblank timers. Use virtual-output frame
callbacks with the fork's generic GLES/Vulkan screencopy render path.
Pending gamma changes are absent for outputs without a DRM scanout.

